.TH AVR\-VM\-CAPABILITIES 1 "" "avr 0.6.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-vm-capabilities \- List available operating systems, architectures, sizes, and quotas.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr vm capabilities
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List available operating systems, architectures, sizes, and quotas.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit capabilities and quotas as JSON.
